  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    min_r, max_r = rows, -1\n    min_c, max_c = cols, -1\n    color = 5\n    \n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] != 0:\n                color = grid[r][c]\n                if r < min_r: min_r = r\n                if r > max_r: max_r = r\n                if c < min_c: min_c = c\n                if c > max_c: max_c = c\n                \n    shape = []\n    for i in range(3):\n        row = []\n        for j in range(3):\n            if grid[min_r + i*3][min_c + j*3] != 0:\n                row.append(1)\n            else:\n                row.append(0)\n        shape.append(row)\n        \n    out = [[0] * 9 for _ in range(9)]\n    for r in range(9):\n        for c in range(9):\n            if shape[r // 3][c // 3] == 1 and shape[r % 3][c % 3] == 1:\n                out[r][c] = color\n                \n    return out",
